Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,voices we take In the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go Get the sails all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Here we are\Nin between the sea and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the sky Ready now for adventure We're itching\Nto try Get ready to roam So all aboard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,now we're set to go Set sail to the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so deep Ready for a truly grand adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think that sounds really\Nfun All this excitement is second to none
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,voices we take In the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that I just won't ever\Nforget It's the way that I felt when our
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,journey was set Now I won't be scared as
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.52,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,long as I keep that\Nfeeling there With that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,let us keep up the pace While\Nenjoying every trip from place to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,place Our timid hearts get the\Nrhythm ingrained So let's keep going,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,adventure awaits So many treasures\Nawait So now let's raise our voices
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in pride Laughing out when they are\Nfound With all the riches in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody rejoices Party on,\Ncause we stand tall and proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous. Be aware it's\Ndangerous. Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.22,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.38,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know those two, but whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.64,0:02:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's that Straw Hat\Nguy, orange hair lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.40,0:02:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and awesome superhero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.76,0:02:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's five down and three to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder where they're hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, she's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:02:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, mistress?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mistress Corona!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.82,0:03:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just us, your loyal servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We brought you to safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but you've been crying about roaches\Nin your sleep for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't see any signs of the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We just found you laying\Ndown, foaming at the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the world could\Nhave done that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it that nose guy from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.30,0:03:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the mansion falling apart?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.02,0:03:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that rumbling?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me those pirates\Nare on a rampage again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates are still going\Non a rampage, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's actually Ors that's\Ncausing all this destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say this, but from what we\Nheard, Ors didn't just wreck the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He crushed the zombie generals, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.98,0:03:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're the strongest\Nzombies we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So it turns out Moria can't\Ncontrol Ors after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he is really big.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you guys! You got my bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:03:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.32,0:04:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be a good time to tell\Nyou that he kind of stumped on Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.57,0:04:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.68,0:04:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's looking for a girl, who\Nknows what he'll do if he finds me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Between him and the pirates,\Nthis place is doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you guys to grab all the\Ntreasure and all the food you can carry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna steal their pirate ship and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What pirate ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, before we all get crushed, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.86,0:04:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Whoa! No! Stop it! What are you\Ndoing? Where am I? Cut it out! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:04:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So she finally woke up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.36,0:04:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that won't stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, my dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I already went through\Nall the boring stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me kiss you, something\Nto me, husband and wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.79,0:05:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Those aren't even human licks and I'm a\Npirate, I'm into adventure, not romance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm the Graveyard King!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be the Graveyard Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that sound wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you do this to me, you traitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You said Master Ab and I\Nwould make a beautiful couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I turn around for five\Nminutes and you're marrying him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you were my friend,\Nbut all you wanted was my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known better\Nthan to trust a thief like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.86,0:05:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got this all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, for one, I was\Nknocked out this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a clue what...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a wedding dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:05:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I wearing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.08,0:06:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all a big misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just bury\Nyour rotting carcass in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,a hole somewhere so I\Ncan get married already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to get married, marry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I would rather die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor little ab ignorant\Nto the terrifying truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.66,0:06:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This so-called woman's real name\Nis Nami, and she's really...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.38,0:06:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot I told her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.32,0:06:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw her in the back. I know I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of\Nhere, you filthy traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's not my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No kidding, I'm right, Lola!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She keeps missing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.26,0:06:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.24,0:07:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.18,0:07:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold him off, but I don't\Nknow how long I can last.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to save you, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, mess your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for a kiss,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,then pucker up because Lola's got\Na big wet one right here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My bride's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bride's right here, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but you can't convince\Nme that my bride's a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now move or suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.72,0:07:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a lowly zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you make me waste so\Nmuch strength disposing of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.16,0:08:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally West up and\Nstopped running, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.26,0:08:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Because wherever you may\Ngo, I'll hunt you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can assure you,\Nyou'll never see me coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Thunder Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.12,0:08:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to save you, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that to Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.76,0:08:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come flying into your husband's arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.18,0:08:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Swing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this isn't enough to beat you,\Nbut I'll be damned if I don't try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It hardly seemed to hurt him at\Nall the last time I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That pervert he was fighting\Nearlier really wore him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He was already well past his limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I win! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I must have hit\Nhis weak spot or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.14,0:09:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.86,0:09:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.80,0:09:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I would have\Ndone if you hadn't shown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.48,0:09:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to thank me, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,we're friends right i owe you an apology
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.12,0:09:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,lola when i first saw you i was scared and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,i told you a lie it's just that i thought
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,if i said it was a man\Nyou'd leave me alone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you're big silly it was\Npretty obvious i guess so
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,wait just a second absalom is completely
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.14,0:10:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,helpless right now i'm\Ngonna make you mine baby
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody in there, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,baby orange hair lady hero
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,guy what was his name again\Noh uh i think it was zoro
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,right no not even close i\Nthink it had an s at the end
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't it shoes? Yeah, I think\Nyou're getting colder. Actually
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,fours no wait that's close
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's oars that's it oh
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:11:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry but my injuries\Nare quite terrible it's fine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.04,0:11:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,we understand you can still\Nmove around though right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah then move yourself out\Nof the way of course hey oars
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's really Luffy's\Nshadow you've got inside you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,then I probably shouldn't\Nhave to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.90,0:11:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But you should never underestimate\Nthe strength of your own crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You tiny pirates are tougher\Nthan I thought you'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of being thrown around so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.14,0:11:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say we turn the tables\Nand throw him around for a change?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:11:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can get behind that. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We've let him have his\Nfun for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.78,0:12:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, whoa, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.36,0:12:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to throw him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't noticed, he's a giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget, he's got Luffy's\Nspeed and fighting skills as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I think he would\Nmake a terrible Pirate King.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So how do we want to approach this, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.50,0:12:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a ton of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them's got to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He has to have some kind of a wait point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're frying a fish this big,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you gotta scale and de-bone it\Nbefore you put it in the pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's not completely\Nhopeless, but I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Smash it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.48,0:12:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant foot score!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not one of Loopy's moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:12:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.36,0:12:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:12:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming right for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, punk, you've only left\Nus with one option here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.22,0:13:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Then feel the power of all of us combined!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Heads up, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking him down with Tactic 15!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.40,0:13:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.46,0:13:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's still untested!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Eyebrows! Stand by!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.38,0:13:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just grab one of our legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This feels like it's about to get weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm stuck in six!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant robot warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.92,0:14:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The left arm still isn't docked yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing to us, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.52,0:14:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and duck onto my left arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, we need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.44,0:14:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do what I'm doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not embarrassing myself like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't do it? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you acting all disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see the robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, you jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do the...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been so relieved\Nto get punched before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It really was embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you bail on us, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We could have formed the\Nrobot warrior Big Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Betrayed by one of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Movie never would have left us\Nhanging like that, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.54,0:15:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever ask me to dock\Nwith you again. I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's time for a fresh start!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.18,0:15:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind me\Nborrowing these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are my heavy nunchucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.54,0:15:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fine, but don't break them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you sack of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.86,0:15:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:16:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let you keep\Nme from saving Nami any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You look good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give his left arm a pounding,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.84,0:16:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I need you to put\Nhim in a submission hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.12,0:16:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Verona!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.04,0:16:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.18,0:16:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The refrigerator's packed to the hilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.30,0:16:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost overflowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of room\Nleft in the pantry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just use that. Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.86,0:16:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And hurry it up with the treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There had better not be one\Nsingle jewel left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how you like\Nmy special oil star!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Triple shot punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.82,0:17:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, eyebrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.80,0:17:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a boost, will ya? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.24,0:17:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're carrying\Nthose big-ass things?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're not mad enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I can handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Army. Tlaire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Power shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Great shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.78,0:17:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, siens lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Big tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.10,0:17:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.60,0:17:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand like this! I'm gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep those planks coming, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And hold the might of my\Nsuper mid-air stair building!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:18:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Franky Skywalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll get us to the top, but\Nit won't hold much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So we gotta make this snappy chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.46,0:18:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.42,0:18:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.28,0:18:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Top!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.36,0:18:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter how big you are, the\Nweak points of a body never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One crack of the jaw, and\Nthe brain goes spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking a little dizzy, and\Nyou've only got one leg holding you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.68,0:18:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat manners!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:18:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:18:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Court!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face is about to get\Nintroduced to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, fall down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But score one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The mansion's crumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.38,0:19:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he flipping around like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a circus act?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.26,0:19:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it sounds stupid, but do you\Nthink somebody could have taken him down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.\NThat does sound stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.12,0:19:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry about me Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alright trust me There's plenty else\Nfor you to be troubled about I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better catch you up to speed on what's\Nbeen happening on the island Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Things have only gotten worse since\Nyour Captain Shadow was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.02,0:20:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria placed his shadow\Ninside a giant super zombie,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and now it's destroying\Neverything in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.86,0:20:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we get Luffy's\Nshadow out of that monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with the whole crew, we'd have\Nto come up with one heck of a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But first,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way I'm going back empty-handed\Nafter all the crap I've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, there it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The treasure chamber!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this really hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid bunch of little sea slugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you really piss me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna grind you down into pirate dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.68,0:21:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've paid my dues. I've given Moria a\Nlarge enough chunk of my life. There's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.54,0:21:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,no way in hell I'm sticking around\NIf I'm in danger of losing all of it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.41,0:21:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,you worthless meatbags\NWe've got to get out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,of here Before the whole\Nisland goes down Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,ma 'am You heard her Get everything off\Nthe dock And on this ship pronto All right
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.26,0:21:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,who the hell is this guy don't look like\Nno zombie what are you doing on this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,ship looking down on us doing all the work\Nthat bastard is about as big as a bear
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,a bear huh you're more astute\Nthan i would have expected
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me, where can I\Nfind your master, Merde?
